==English==

===Interjection===
{{en-interj|head=[[fuck]] [[me]]!}}

# {{rfd-sense}} {{vulgar|literally}} {{n-g|Used [[imperative]]ly when one wants a partner to [[have sex]] with oneself, often in a [[rough]] manner.}}
# {{vulgar|slang}} {{n-g|An expression of [[surprise]], [[contempt]], [[outrage]], [[disgust]], [[boredom]], [[frustration]], or of [[dismay]] at undesired events happening to oneself.}}
#: ''Oh, '''fuck me!''' I forgot to pay that parking ticket; now they want me to appear in court!''

